<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>明日方舟 - 薇薇安娜‧德羅斯特 A6 明信片</title>
  <!-- Google Fonts: Cinzel, Cormorant Garamond, Noto Serif TC -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400;1,600&family=Noto+Serif+TC:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Lucide Icons -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@0.460.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      --gold-light: #f3e5ab;
      --gold-main: #d4af37;
      --gold-muted: #aa8c3c;
      --dark-bg: #0c0d14;
      --paper-bg: #faf7f0;
      --paper-ink: #1e1b18;
      --crimson: #7a1c24;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #16161a;
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 30%, #25252c 0%, #101014 100%);
      font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14mm;
      padding: 15mm 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
      print-color-adjust: exact;
    }

    /* A6 橫式尺寸: 148mm × 105mm */
    .postcard {
      width: 148mm;
      height: 105mm;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8mm 20mm rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75), 0 0 0 1px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.25);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* ==================== 正面 FRONT ==================== */
    .front {
      background-color: var(--dark-bg);
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    /* 主圖裁切與構圖：放大約 110% 並鎖定神情、光劍與右手燭台 */
    .front-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url('cd4ab176da252b642ebfac2074fb57f1702338129.png');
      background-size: 112% auto;
      background-position: 50% 18%;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    /* 局部暗角漸層，不遮擋中央畫面，僅提升邊緣文字可讀性 */
    .front-overlay {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: 
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10, 11, 18, 0.55) 0%, rgba(10, 11, 18, 0) 24%, rgba(10, 11, 18, 0) 68%, rgba(10, 11, 18, 0.85) 100%),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(10, 11, 18, 0.65) 0%, rgba(10, 11, 18, 0) 35%);
      z-index: 2;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* 細緻古典雙線內框 */
    .front-frame {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 4mm;
      border: 0.25mm solid rgba(243, 229, 171, 0.38);
      z-index: 3;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .front-frame::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0.8mm;
      border: 0.15mm solid rgba(243, 229, 171, 0.18);
    }

    /* 頂部資訊列 */
    .front-top {
      position: absolute;
      top: 6.5mm;
      left: 7mm;
      right: 7mm;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      z-index: 4;
    }

    .faction-badge {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2.2mm;
    }

    .logo-leithanien {
      width: 9mm;
      height: 9mm;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9));
      opacity: 0.92;
    }

    .faction-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .faction-en {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      color: var(--gold-light);
      text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .event-zh {
      font-size: 6pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      margin-top: 0.5mm;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
    }

    .logo-arknights {
      height: 6.8mm;
      width: auto;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85));
      opacity: 0.92;
    }

    /* 左側直排德文詩句裝飾 (仿古典詩集雜誌邊欄) */
    .front-side-quote {
      position: absolute;
      left: 7mm;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(180deg);
      writing-mode: vertical-rl;
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 7pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: rgba(243, 229, 171, 0.72);
      z-index: 4;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2mm;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
    }

    .front-side-quote::after {
      content: '';
      display: inline-block;
      width: 0.2mm;
      height: 10mm;
      background: rgba(243, 229, 171, 0.45);
    }

    /* 底部角色主標題 (避開右側手部燭台) */
    .front-bottom {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 6.5mm;
      left: 7mm;
      right: 7mm;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      z-index: 4;
    }

    .character-title {
      max-width: 90mm;
    }

    .title-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.5mm;
      font-size: 6.8pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      color: var(--gold-light);
      margin-bottom: 0.8mm;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
    }

    .title-tag i {
      width: 3mm;
      height: 3mm;
      color: var(--gold-main);
    }

    .name-en {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 15.5pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      line-height: 1.05;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
    }

    .name-zh {
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      margin-top: 1.2mm;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
    }

    /* 右下角極簡台詞點綴 (不遮擋燭火) */
    .front-corner-caption {
      text-align: right;
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: rgba(243, 229, 171, 0.85);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-shadow: 0 1px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1);
      padding-bottom: 0.5mm;
    }

    /* ==================== 背面 BACK ==================== */
    .back {
      background-color: var(--paper-bg);
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 15% 85%, rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.08) 0%, transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(122, 28, 36, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
      color: var(--paper-ink);
      padding: 7.5mm 8.5mm;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    /* 背面古典細框 */
    .back-border {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 4mm;
      border: 0.3mm solid rgba(170, 140, 60, 0.45);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .back-border::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0.8mm;
      border: 0.15mm solid rgba(170, 140, 60, 0.22);
    }

    /* 萊塔尼亞陣營大型浮水印 (將白圖轉為古典金棕浮水印) */
    .back-watermark {
      position: absolute;
      left: 28%;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      width: 68mm;
      height: 68mm;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: invert(0.85) sepia(1) hue-rotate(5deg) saturate(1.8);
      opacity: 0.06;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    /* 背面頂部標題與郵票區 */
    .back-header {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .postcard-heading {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .postcard-heading-en {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 11pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      color: var(--paper-ink);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2mm;
    }

    .postcard-heading-en i {
      width: 3.6mm;
      height: 3.6mm;
      color: var(--gold-muted);
    }

    .postcard-heading-sub {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: #6e6256;
      margin-top: 0.6mm;
    }

    /* 郵票框與郵戳組合 */
    .stamp-group {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* 仿古郵戳 */
    .postmark {
      position: absolute;
      left: -13mm;
      top: 2mm;
      width: 17mm;
      height: 17mm;
      border: 0.35mm solid rgba(122, 28, 36, 0.55);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transform: rotate(-14deg);
      color: rgba(122, 28, 36, 0.65);
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 4.5pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-align: center;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .postmark::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 1.1mm;
      border: 0.2mm dashed rgba(122, 28, 36, 0.45);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .postmark i {
      width: 3mm;
      height: 3mm;
      margin-bottom: 0.4mm;
    }

    /* 郵票框：嵌入角色模組2 (天文望遠鏡與燭台) */
    .stamp-box {
      width: 19mm;
      height: 23mm;
      border: 0.35mm solid rgba(170, 140, 60, 0.65);
      background: #f3ede0;
      padding: 1mm;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 0.5mm #faf7f0;
    }

    .stamp-box img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 17.5mm;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25));
    }

    .stamp-label {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 4.5pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #6e5a36;
    }

    /* 背面主體內容區 (左：官方介紹與留言區 / 右：精選台詞與收件欄) */
    .back-body {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      flex: 1;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.12fr 0.88fr;
      gap: 6mm;
      margin-top: 1.5mm;
      margin-bottom: 1.5mm;
    }

    /* 中央分隔線 */
    .back-body::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      left: 53.5%;
      top: 1mm;
      bottom: 1mm;
      width: 0.25mm;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 0%, rgba(170, 140, 60, 0.5) 15%, rgba(170, 140, 60, 0.5) 85%, transparent 100%);
    }

    /* 左欄：介紹文字、留言空間與角色模組1徽章 */
    .left-col {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-right: 3mm;
    }

    .intro-card {
      border-left: 0.6mm solid var(--crimson);
      padding-left: 2.5mm;
      background: rgba(170, 140, 60, 0.05);
      padding-top: 1.2mm;
      padding-bottom: 1.2mm;
      padding-right: 1.5mm;
    }

    .intro-text {
      font-size: 6.8pt;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #2c2520;
      text-align: justify;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    /* 留言書寫區 + 角色模組1 (Final Line 燭台玫瑰詩集) */
    .message-space {
      flex: 1;
      position: relative;
      margin-top: 2mm;
      border-top: 0.2mm dashed rgba(170, 140, 60, 0.35);
      padding-top: 1.8mm;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .message-hint {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 5.5pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: #8c7b65;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.2mm;
    }

    .message-hint i {
      width: 2.6mm;
      height: 2.6mm;
    }

    .module-emblem-wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .module-quote-de {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 7pt;
      color: #5c4e3c;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .module-quote-de span {
      display: block;
      font-family: 'Noto Serif TC', serif;
      font-style: normal;
      font-size: 5.8pt;
      color: #7c6f5e;
      margin-top: 0.4mm;
    }

    .module-img-primary {
      width: 22mm;
      height: 22mm;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18));
      margin-right: -1mm;
      margin-bottom: -1mm;
    }

    /* 右欄：收件地址欄與精選台詞 */
    .right-col {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding-left: 2mm;
    }

    .address-section {
      margin-top: 2mm;
    }

    .address-header {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 6pt;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: #7c6f5e;
      margin-bottom: 2.5mm;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.2mm;
    }

    .address-header i {
      width: 2.8mm;
      height: 2.8mm;
      color: var(--gold-muted);
    }

    .address-lines {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4.2mm;
    }

    .address-line {
      border-bottom: 0.25mm solid rgba(110, 98, 86, 0.4);
      height: 3.2mm;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 5.5pt;
      color: rgba(110, 98, 86, 0.55);
      padding-left: 1mm;
    }

    /* 角色精選語錄區 */
    .voice-quotes {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2mm;
      padding-top: 2mm;
      border-top: 0.2mm solid rgba(170, 140, 60, 0.3);
    }

    .voice-item {
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .voice-en {
      font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 6.8pt;
      color: #3b322b;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .voice-zh {
      font-size: 5.8pt;
      color: #6e6256;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-top: 0.3mm;
    }

    /* 背面底部版權與陣營資訊列 */
    .back-footer {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-top: 0.25mm solid rgba(170, 140, 60, 0.4);
      padding-top: 1.8mm;
      font-size: 5.8pt;
      color: #6e6256;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .footer-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2mm;
    }

    .footer-left i {
      width: 2.8mm;
      height: 2.8mm;
      color: var(--crimson);
    }

    .footer-logo-ark {
      height: 3.8mm;
      object-fit: contain;
      filter: invert(0.85);
      opacity: 0.75;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- ==================== 明信片正面 (FRONT) ==================== -->
  <section class="postcard front" aria-label="明信片正面">
    <!-- 裁切後的主圖 -->
    <div class="front-bg"></div>
    <!-- 邊緣漸層保護文字可讀性 -->
    <div class="front-overlay"></div>
    <!-- 古典雙線邊框 -->
    <div class="front-frame"></div>

    <!-- 頂部：萊塔尼亞陣營與明日方舟 Logo -->
    <header class="front-top">
      <div class="faction-badge">
        <img src="20210120051634!Logo_莱塔尼亚.png" alt="Leithanien Logo" class="logo-leithanien">
        <div class="faction-text">
          <span class="faction-en">LEITHANIEN</span>
          <span class="event-zh">崔林特爾梅之金 ‧ Zwillingstürme im Herbst</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img src="Logo_明日方舟.png" alt="明日方舟 Logo" class="logo-arknights">
    </header>

    <!-- 左側邊欄：德文閒置台詞直排裝飾 -->
    <aside class="front-side-quote">
      Mein Tag war heiter, glücklich meine Nacht.
    </aside>

    <!-- 底部：角色稱號與姓名 (避開右側手部燭火) -->
    <footer class="front-bottom">
      <div class="character-title">
        <div class="title-tag">
          <i data-lucide="flame"></i>
          <span>燭騎士 ‧ THE CANDLE KNIGHT</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="name-en">VIVIANA DROSTE</h1>
        <p class="name-zh">薇薇安娜‧德羅斯特</p>
      </div>
      <div class="front-corner-caption">
        "Let time rest upon this unlit night."
      </div>
    </footer>
  </section>

  <!-- ==================== 明信片背面 (BACK) ==================== -->
  <section class="postcard back" aria-label="明信片背面">
    <!-- 內縮古典邊框 -->
    <div class="back-border"></div>
    <!-- 萊塔尼亞陣營浮水印 -->
    <img src="20210120051634!Logo_莱塔尼亚.png" alt="" class="back-watermark">

    <!-- 頂部：明信片標題與模組郵票 -->
    <header class="back-header">
      <div class="postcard-heading">
        <div class="postcard-heading-en">
          <i data-lucide="sparkles"></i>
          <span>POSTCARD ‧ LEITHANIEN</span>
        </div>
        <div class="postcard-heading-sub">Viviana Droste — The Candle Knight of Leithanien</div>
      </div>

      <!-- 郵戳與角色模組3郵票 -->
      <div class="stamp-group">
        <div class="postmark">
          <i data-lucide="flame"></i>
          <span>LEITHANIEN</span>
          <span>ZWILLINGSTÜRME</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stamp-box" title="THE UNFORESEEABLE FOR VIVIANA">
          <img src="pasted-1788277241690-0.png" alt="角色模組：望遠鏡與燭台">
          <span class="stamp-label">ARKNIGHTS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- 中央主體：左欄官方介紹與留言區、右欄收件線與精選台詞 -->
    <div class="back-body">
      <!-- 左欄 -->
      <div class="left-col">
        <div class="intro-card">
          <p class="intro-text">
            燭騎士薇薇安娜·德羅斯特，言語無法形容她的美好，只有她映照光輝的眼眸令人沉醉。今夜，金盞花為她盛開。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="message-space">
          <div class="message-hint">
            <i data-lucide="feather"></i>
            <span>MESSAGE / 留言區</span>
          </div>

          <div class="module-emblem-wrap">
            <div class="module-quote-de">
              "Mein Tag war heiter, glücklich meine Nacht."
              <span>……我的白晝晴朗，我的夜晚幸福。</span>
            </div>
            <img src="pasted-1788277232350-0.png" alt="角色模組：FINAL LINE" class="module-img-primary">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 右欄 -->
      <div class="right-col">
        <div class="address-section">
          <div class="address-header">
            <i data-lucide="mail"></i>
            <span>RECIPIENT / 收件人資訊</span>
          </div>
          <div class="address-lines">
            <div class="address-line">TO:</div>
            <div class="address-line">ADD:</div>
            <div class="address-line"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="voice-quotes">
          <div class="voice-item">
            <div class="voice-en">"I listen, to this passing silence. / I wait, for that belated serenity."</div>
            <div class="voice-zh">我願傾聽此刻的沉默。／我在等待遲來的寧靜。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="voice-item">
            <div class="voice-en">"Let time rest upon this unlit night."</div>
            <div class="voice-zh">讓時間停在這個無燭的夜晚吧。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
